<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets $750 million FRN.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets $750 million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG (RATED AA2/AA-)</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    30.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -12.5 BP  PAY DATE   L29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.74     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.74</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
